        "Description": "Good Evening, 47.\r\rOur Client, senior mechanic Ben Finch, discovered 3 maintenance crew members, Sykes, Blackburn, and Ferguson, have rigged the yacht&apos;s engine to explode. Not knowing what to do, he reached out to us.\r\rFinch is doing his duty on the bottom deck, paranoid about any future interrogation, he requires you leave no evidence of your pressence near him and avoiding his sight entirely.\r\rNeutralize the sabotage threat cleanly and extract unseen.\r\rI&apos;ll leave you to prepare.",
